---
import "../../css/styles.css";
import "../../css/accessibility.css";
import "../../css/motion-narrative.css";
import "../../css/lab.css";
import MotionNarrative from "../../components/MotionNarrative.astro";
const siteRoot = new URL(import.meta.env.SITE);
const siteBase = new URL(import.meta.env.BASE_URL, siteRoot);
const pageUrl = new URL("lab/", siteBase);
const englishUrl = new URL("en/lab/", siteBase);
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="EasyKiConverter 3D 技术实验室：按需加载真实 STEP 网格与剖面交互实验。" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={pageUrl} />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="zh-CN" href={pageUrl} />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href={englishUrl} />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href={pageUrl} />
    <meta property="og:title" content="EasyKiConverter · 3D 技术实验室" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="独立的 STEP、网格和截面交互实验，不影响官网首页加载。" />
    <meta property="og:url" content={pageUrl} />
    <title>EasyKiConverter · 3D 技术实验室</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="lab-header shell">
      <a class="brand" href={siteBase.href} aria-label="返回 EasyKiConverter 首页">EasyKiConverter / Lab</a>
      <nav aria-label="实验室导航"><a href={siteBase.href}>首页</a><a href={englishUrl}>English</a></nav>
    </header>
    <main>
      <section class="lab-intro" aria-labelledby="lab-title">
        <p class="kicker">按需加载 · EXPERIMENTAL 3D</p>
        <h1 id="lab-title">真实几何，独立实验。</h1>
        <p>这里保留 STEP、Three.js、剖面和拓扑研究能力。官网首页保持轻量，只有进入实验室时才加载 CAD/WASM 运行时。</p>
        <p class="lab-warning">实验室资源约 19 MB，适合桌面浏览器与技术验证；下载入口和产品信息请返回首页。</p>
      </section>
      <MotionNarrative lang="zh" />
    </main>
    <footer class="site-footer shell"><p>© EasyKiConverter · GPL-3.0</p><a href={siteBase.href}>返回首页</a></footer>
    <script>
      import { setupModel } from "../../js/model-viewer";
      setupModel();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
